id: pm-n912nt
title: "Transactional preview portability: canonical race fixtures and persistent invalid-path recovery"
description: "GH-1377/1378/1380 expose separate portable-boundary regressions in the semantic-preview acceptance added by pm-gh1370: race injection compares unresolved aliases to canonical paths, a search cursor fixture hashes an unresolved Windows root, and ENOENT below a regular file is incorrectly treated as disappearance on Windows. Repair concrete causes and make these contracts mandatory before merge without weakening assertions or platform coverage."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[4]: context-management,github-intake,portability,regression
created_at: "2026-10-03T20:11:29.225Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-03T23:35:49.933Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-03T23:35:47.301Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-03T23:35:47.301Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 180
acceptance_criteria: Canonical settings race injection executes on physical and aliased roots across macOS Windows and Linux;Persistent invalid intermediate path errors retain native diagnostics while vanished entries retain retryable conflicts;Search cursor continuation fixture hashes the actual resolved tracker;Required platform checks exercise settings search and snapshot cases with unchanged assertions;Full-source coverage remains 100/100/100/100
parent: pm-o2kc
risk: medium
confidence: high
resolution: "Resolved search cursor tracker scopes, classified disappearing preview paths through existing ancestors while preserving native persistent-path errors, repaired physical/alias settings race fixtures, required Windows/macOS regression checks with build reuse, and registered concrete recurrence evidence without relaxing graph, coverage, performance or organization gates."
expected_result: "Real settings race, cursor and snapshot controls pass on Linux, Windows and macOS, persistent invalid ancestors keep their diagnostics, and all source coverage categories remain exactly 100 percent under mandatory hosted gates."
actual_result: "On source 6bdb71d86, linked 211 runtime and 33 gate-policy tests pass. Nightly 37160329211 passes Ubuntu Node22/24/25, macOS24, both Windows24 shards and quality. Required CI 37160212125 is green, including exact coverage across 762 files, static/performance/graph/history/analyzers and mutation evidence (336 mutants,329 killed,7 classified equivalent,no gate failures). The isolated Node22.18 packed collector timeout passed its one unchanged retry; the original failure and local import-cost refusal remain recorded. Recent bounded Sentry/telemetry gates pass and no GitHub security alert is open. Source publication is pending; unrelated GH1383 remains open and unclaimed."
