learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-03T21:50:57.168Z","harness:codex","A native ENOENT is not by itself evidence of a disappearing snapshot path. Verify the nearest existing ancestor and preserve diagnostics for regular files, links, permission failures, and unavailable roots. Race fixtures must inject against the same canonical path the implementation opens. Register concrete recurrence checks when recording recurs_from edges, and organize new SDK specs in their existing domain folders."
